# DotStack Specification: Axiom Tech Technical Stack

## 1. Technology Stack Overview

```
[ Frontend / UI Layer ]      Streamlit Web App / CLI
          │
[ Agent Orchestration ]      LangGraph + LangChain Core
          │
[ LLM Reasoning Engine ]    NVIDIA NIM API (meta/llama-3.1-70b-instruct / mistral)
          │
[ Vector Storage & RAG ]     Pinecone Vector Database
          │
[ Data Ingestion Engine ]    PyPDF, python-docx, openpyxl, pandas, BeautifulSoup4
          │
[ Infrastructure & Cloud ]  Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI Compute / GenAI Containers)
```

## 2. Dependencies & Components

| Component | Library / Tool | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Language** | Python 3.11+ | Primary runtime environment |
| **LLM Engine** | `langchain-nvidia-ai-endpoints` | High-performance inference via NVIDIA NIM API |
| **Orchestration** | `langgraph` >= 0.2.0 | Multi-agent graph state routing & feedback loops |
| **Vector DB** | `pinecone-client`, `langchain-pinecone` | Vector indexing, metadata filtering, semantic search |
| **Embeddings** | NVIDIA Embeddings / SentenceTransformers | Dense vector representation for text chunks |
| **Multi-Format Parsers** | `pypdf`, `python-docx`, `openpyxl`, `pandas`, `beautifulsoup4`, `markdown` | File ingestion (PDF, DOCX, XLSX, CSV, JSON, HTML, MD) |
| **Web UI** | `streamlit` | Modern conversational user interface for employees |
| **Environment Configuration**| `python-dotenv`, `pydantic-settings` | Secure credential management |

## 3. Environment Variables (.env)
```env
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-...
PINECONE_API_KEY=pcsk_...
PINECONE_INDEX_NAME=axiom-tech-knowledge
PINECONE_ENVIRONMENT=us-east-1
EMBEDDING_MODEL=nvidia/nv-embed-v1
LLM_MODEL=meta/llama-3.1-70b-instruct
```
